        "description": {
            "value": "<p>A gentle breeze seems to flow through the mesh of this +1 chain mail, which protects against one of the Darklands' signature threats: bad air. You can hold your breath for 10 rounds longer than usual before suffocating, and the armor grants you a +1 item bonus to saving throws against inhaled threats, such as inhaled poisons.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Gasp</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You enter an area where you can't breathe or where breathing would harm you</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Your armor filters air to you, allowing you to breathe without harm for 10 minutes or until you return to an environment where you can breathe normally.</p>"
